# Production allowlist: everything else stays local and ignored.
# Add new runtime or deployment files explicitly.
# Maintained PR checks are also tracked; scratch checks remain ignored.
*

# Repository metadata
!/.gitattributes
!/.gitignore
!/.dockerignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/.github/
!/.github/workflows/
!/.github/workflows/pr-tests.yml
!/.github/workflows/rust-parity.yml
# Research, plans, handoffs, and benchmark evidence stay private unless the
# repository owner explicitly authorizes their publication.
!/Cargo.toml
!/Cargo.lock
!/rust-toolchain.toml
!/crates/
!/crates/searchcord-archive/
!/crates/searchcord-archive/Cargo.toml
